# ============================================================================
# EDGE BROKER ACL -- site2
#
# Only this site's application connects here. It is confined to its own site
# prefix so a misconfigured app cannot publish into another site's namespace --
# which the bridge would otherwise forward to the cloud in good faith.
#
# The bridge itself is internal to mosquitto and is not subject to this file;
# it is authorised on the CLOUD side as the bridge-site2 user.
# ============================================================================

user edge-app
topic write sites/site2/telemetry/+
topic write sites/site2/health/+
topic read  sites/site2/command/+/req
topic write sites/site2/command/+/res
topic read  $SYS/#

# --- read-only inspection account (MQTT Explorer UI) ------------------------
# Attached to this site's LAN, so it can keep watching the local broker spool
# while the WAN uplink is cut -- which is the whole point of looking.
user observer
topic read sites/#
topic read $SYS/#
